      "widgets_values": [
        "A candid family snapshot taken on a phone in an American small-town neighborhood during a gentle snowfall. Slightly imperfect framing, natural soft daylight, a little motion blur, and the cozy, unpolished feel of a real home photo.\n\nIn a front yard, a young child in a puffy red snowsuit, a knitted hat with a pompom, and mittens leaps forward into a deep, fluffy snowdrift, arms flung wide and face lit with pure delight. Right beside the child, a white farm duck flaps its wings and hops into the snow at the same moment, a spray of powder bursting up around them both.\n\nBehind them, a white wooden house with a porch, a few strings of warm holiday lights, a mailbox capped with snow, and bare trees line a quiet street. Large snowflakes drift through the air, some close to the lens and softly out of focus."
